  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v5.2.25 - WebGPU dispatch batching: one JS crossing per submit (host cost per dispatch 433 -> ~40 us), ordered batched uploads, @workgroup_size patch only on a shader-resolve miss. IExternalImageCopier (video/img -> GPU buffer). Fixes: WebGPU coalesce ordering, OpenCL sub-view MemSet, WebGL host writes wiping kernel results, Wasm 2D/3D view extents. Requires SpawnDev.SpawnJS 2.1.20. See CHANGELOG.md.",
